{"ID":"20251103113736-y6c1utd","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251103113736-y6c1utd","title":"UPL8——影响 GPU 性能的主要因素","type":"doc","updated":"20251104120252"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103144939-19vnko1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251103144939-19vnko1","updated":"20251104111001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"影响 GPU 性能的主要因素"}]},{"ID":"20251103145003-p5hojys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103145003-p5hojys","updated":"20251103145028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在开发时注意这些优化点，可以减少性能问题的发生\n当发生性能问题时 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong u","TextMarkTextContent":"先定位问题，再针对性解决问题"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n结合性能分析窗口、帧调试窗口来分析定位问题，不要凭感觉"}]},{"ID":"20251103113736-2y978x4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251103113736-2y978x4","updated":"20251104111001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"填充率"}]},{"ID":"20251103113909-fr1kkjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103113909-fr1kkjk","updated":"20251103113922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"填充率（Fill Rate）是 GPU 的一个性能指标，是最经典的衡量图形处理器片元阶段吞吐能力的指标之一\n表示 GPU 在单位时间内能处理（写入）的像素数量\n一般用 像素 / 秒 (Pixels per Second，GPixel/s = 十亿像素/秒，MPixel/s = 百万像素每秒) 来衡量\n相当于填充率决定了每帧能处理多少个像素"}]},{"ID":"20251103113909-xnbhf20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103113909-xnbhf20","updated":"20251103113942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设 RTX4090 GPU 的理论填充率为 450 Gpixel/s = 4500 亿像素/s\n一个 60 FPS的游戏，每帧该 GPU 理论上能处理 4500亿 / 60 = 75亿像素\n即 每帧可以处理 75 亿 个片元"}]},{"ID":"20251103113909-ax5r4k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103113909-ax5r4k8","updated":"20251103113954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果是一个4K显示器 3840 × 2160 ≈ 829 万个像素\n每个像素只处理一次的话\n理论上来说，RTX4090 可以每帧处理 4K 画面 75亿 / 829万 ≈ 905次"}]},{"ID":"20251103113909-zmovzuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103113909-zmovzuw","updated":"20251103114051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而一般的高端移动设备的 GPU 填充率 一般是 20 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 40 Gpixel/s = 200 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 400 亿像素/s\n那一个 60 FPS 的游戏，每帧该 GPU 理论上能处理 200 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 400亿 / 60 = 3.33 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6.66 亿像素\n即 每帧可以处理 3.33 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6.66 亿个片元"}]},{"ID":"20251103113909-8bn51ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103113909-8bn51ur","updated":"20251104111001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果是一个 4K 显示器 3840 × 2160 ≈ 829 万个像素\n每个像素只处理一次的话，理论上来说，高端移动设备的 GPU 可以每帧处理 4K 画面 3.33 ~ 6.66亿 / 829万 ≈ 40 ~ 80次"}]},{"ID":"20251103113909-dz8b3c9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103113909-dz8b3c9","updated":"20251103114116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：GPU 填充率就是 GPU 每秒能画多少个像素"}]},{"ID":"20251103114118-9knak5k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251103114118-9knak5k","updated":"20251103114555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么填充率会影响性能"}]},{"ID":"20251103114142-qacwr5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114142-qacwr5j","updated":"20251103114155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屏幕上每个像素都可能需要执行片元着色器、纹理采样、混合写入等操作，这些工作就是在消耗填充率\n如果我们把 GPU 想象成一个喷漆机器，屏幕分辨率越高，需要喷的点就越多，特效越复杂（模糊、透明、Bloom 等），每个点需要喷好几层\n当喷漆速度赶不上需求，就会产生性能问题"}]},{"ID":"20251103114142-zw6bwdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114142-zw6bwdz","updated":"20251103114518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"造成性能瓶颈的原因："}]},{"ID":"20251103114230-2olkk3x","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114230-2olkk3x","updated":"20251103114512"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114230-u9iai6f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114230-u9iai6f","updated":"20251103114230"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114226-469b7gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114226-469b7gx","updated":"20251103114233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过高的分辨率"}]},{"ID":"20251103114341-6a4pgla","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20251103114341-6a4pgla","updated":"20251103114413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名称"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分辨率"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像素总数"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"720P"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1280 × 720"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"92 万多"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1080P"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1920 × 1080"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"207 万多"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2K"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2560 × 1440"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"369 万多"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3K"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2880 × 1620"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"466 万多"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4K"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3840 × 2160"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"829 万多"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8K"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7680 × 4320"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3318 万多"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114236-1fuqo01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114236-1fuqo01","updated":"20251103114240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"随着分辨率的增加，GPU 每帧要处理的像素（片元）会指数增加，会大幅消耗填充率"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114230-t549mqd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114230-t549mqd","updated":"20251103114230"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114142-srujq2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114142-srujq2w","updated":"20251103114419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全屏特效或后处理效果"}]},{"ID":"20251103114420-ktqvy8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114420-ktqvy8b","updated":"20251103114420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果我们在游戏开发中使用屏幕后处理效果\n比如边缘检测、Bloom、运动模糊、高斯模糊、全局雾效、景深（DOF）等等效果\n它们会对每个像素进行多次采样和计算，会大幅消耗填充率"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114230-ja2xwt3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114230-ja2xwt3","updated":"20251103114230"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114142-9v5spdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114142-9v5spdb","updated":"20251103114425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多重采样抗锯齿（MSAA）"}]},{"ID":"20251103114426-hz438c5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114426-hz438c5","updated":"20251103114430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4×MSAA 相当于每个像素算 4 次，填充率需求翻倍"}]},{"ID":"20251103114438-evj9nmq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114438-evj9nmq","updated":"20251103114439"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114439-f89nxp3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114439-f89nxp3","updated":"20251103114439"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114439-4qgmajl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114439-4qgmajl","updated":"20251103114439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"普通渲染：1 像素 = 1 个采样点（像素中心）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114440-759s80t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114440-759s80t","updated":"20251103114440"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114440-o9t50yy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114440-o9t50yy","updated":"20251103114440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4×MSAA：1 像素 = 4 个采样点，判断覆盖率，最后合成一个像素颜色"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114230-qdauzvd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114230-qdauzvd","updated":"20251103114230"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114142-x9h90p0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114142-x9h90p0","updated":"20251103114444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"透明/半透明物体"}]},{"ID":"20251103114445-w0p3az1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114445-w0p3az1","updated":"20251103114445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每一层都要计算片元，实际填充量成倍增加\n对于不透明物体来说，可以通过深度写入丢弃大量遮挡的片元，只用算一次\n但是对于透明/半透明物体来说，必须逐层混合，每个片元需要重复计算多次"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114230-70z5657","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114230-70z5657","updated":"20251103114512"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114142-9yhyu4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114142-9yhyu4m","updated":"20251103114512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多 Pass Shader"}]},{"ID":"20251103114455-mmp6of6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114455-mmp6of6","updated":"20251103114512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个 Pass 都会单独进行计算，Pass 中会重算片元（像素）\n假设一个物体表面有 1000 个可见片元"}]},{"ID":"20251103114504-lo2r9hu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114504-lo2r9hu","updated":"20251103114505"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114505-hfdixhp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114505-hfdixhp","updated":"20251103114505"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114505-f4eguoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114505-f4eguoo","updated":"20251103114505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 个 Pass 带来 1000 次片元着色计算"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114506-pmk7xei","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114506-pmk7xei","updated":"20251103114506"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114506-n9mhbra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114506-n9mhbra","updated":"20251103114506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 个 Pass 带来 3000 次片元着色计算"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114503-rykq4vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114503-rykq4vd","updated":"20251103114503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相当于在同一像素上多次覆盖绘制"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114142-fkpe7e7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114142-fkpe7e7","updated":"20251103114142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251103114142-15f0jes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114142-15f0jes","updated":"20251103114529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：填充率始终有上限，当单位时间内处理的像素（片元）数量增加，就会消耗填充率，当达到一定瓶颈，就可能会给GPU带来压力"}]},{"ID":"20251103114532-8z9tm4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114532-8z9tm4j","updated":"20251103114538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般增加压力的情况为：分辨率高、屏幕后处理多、半透明多、多 Pass Shader 、抗锯齿 等\n一切会增加片元计算次数的行为都增加 GPU 开销"}]},{"ID":"20251103114545-ohbv1jh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251103114545-ohbv1jh","updated":"20251103115239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于填充率的优化思路"}]},{"ID":"20251103114701-ec54tx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114701-ec54tx4","updated":"20251103114701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了解了填充率影响性能的原理，那么优化思路就很容易得到了"}]},{"ID":"20251103114720-1ka3e0u","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114720-1ka3e0u","updated":"20251103114936"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114720-oit8fde","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114720-oit8fde","updated":"20251103114720"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114710-0kn1fgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114710-0kn1fgp","updated":"20251103114721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低要处理的像素（片元）数量"}]},{"ID":"20251103114732-l8tgis6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114732-l8tgis6","updated":"20251103114732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114731-udmrb18","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114731-udmrb18","updated":"20251103114731"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114731-hx9ikmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114731-hx9ikmx","updated":"20251103114750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低分辨率"}]},{"ID":"20251103114752-ouyo3w3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114752-ouyo3w3","updated":"20251103114752"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114751-dww7bi0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114751-dww7bi0","updated":"20251103114751"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114751-yqwysyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114751-yqwysyp","updated":"20251103114756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态分辨率（Dynamic Resolution Scaling）"}]},{"ID":"20251103114803-ye8jofv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114803-ye8jofv","updated":"20251103114829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本原理：\n在 GPU 压力大时，降低渲染分辨率，然后再放大到屏幕分辨率输出\n在 GPU 空闲时，提高渲染分辨率，获得更清晰的画面\n目标是保持 稳定帧率，URP 项目中有动态分辨率功能开关"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114756-rmaic31","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114756-rmaic31","updated":"20251103114756"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114756-1i2xrr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114756-1i2xrr3","updated":"20251103114800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注视点渲染（Foveated Rendering）"}]},{"ID":"20251103114833-bj1ytyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114833-bj1ytyg","updated":"20251103114846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本原理：\n人眼的视觉分辨率，中央注视点区域最清晰，周边区域分辨率敏感度低\n在中央区域渲染高分辨率，在边缘区域渲染低分辨率，从而减少像素处理量\n一般 VR 项目中会使用\n一般 VR 设备会提供对应功能，通过设备 API 开启"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114801-v4ayaon","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114801-v4ayaon","updated":"20251103114801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114801-gaub3b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114801-gaub3b1","updated":"20251103114853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低项目分辨率"}]},{"ID":"20251103114854-y385tlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114854-y385tlu","updated":"20251103114854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基于目标设备，合理设定项目目标分辨率"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114736-k68uptr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114736-k68uptr","updated":"20251103114736"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114736-57bbvsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114736-57bbvsh","updated":"20251103114900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少或优化屏幕后处理效果的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251103114900-6rmkxqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114900-6rmkxqk","updated":"20251103114900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 1/2 或 1/4 分辨率下渲染，或直接不使用"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114738-sn6gxar","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114738-sn6gxar","updated":"20251103114738"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114738-lz3485v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114738-lz3485v","updated":"20251103114902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低抗锯齿采样次数或关闭"}]},{"ID":"20251103114903-pzp7c7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114903-pzp7c7a","updated":"20251103114917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4×MSAA ——\u003e 2×MSAA 或关闭"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114720-xcju7rt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114720-xcju7rt","updated":"20251103114936"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114701-egr59r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114701-egr59r1","updated":"20251103114922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少单个像素（片元）计算量"}]},{"ID":"20251103114923-sgtnf8q","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114923-sgtnf8q","updated":"20251103114936"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114933-sexddvg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114933-sexddvg","updated":"20251103114933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114933-33e47vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114933-33e47vw","updated":"20251103115011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"控制 Shader Pass 数量"}]},{"ID":"20251103114934-0n37l3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114934-0n37l3e","updated":"20251103114934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能合并的效果放在一个 Pass，避免片元被重复算"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114933-cvq8ldq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114933-cvq8ldq","updated":"20251103114933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114933-t57lf98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114933-t57lf98","updated":"20251103114933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少半透明的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251103114935-eojuqcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114935-eojuqcv","updated":"20251103115006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少层数，必要时用 透明测试（AlphaTest）\n可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241120123139-t3fekhe","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US3S3L4——透明度测试"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114933-b1ghzar","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114933-b1ghzar","updated":"20251103114936"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114933-wvgcsfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114933-wvgcsfd","updated":"20251103114933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合理使用光照模式"}]},{"ID":"20251103114936-gum3jcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114936-gum3jcg","updated":"20251103114936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少用逐像素实时光照"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114933-8egkab9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114933-8egkab9","updated":"20251103115107"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114933-srvzsd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114933-srvzsd1","updated":"20251103114933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少纹理采样次数"}]},{"ID":"20251103114938-j96i92r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114938-j96i92r","updated":"20251103115107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并贴图、使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230727203130-4rvs7r1","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Mipmap"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103114720-yf0dvnp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103114720-yf0dvnp","updated":"20251103115103"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103114701-l78pd6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103114701-l78pd6r","updated":"20251103115022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免无效像素（片元）计算"}]},{"ID":"20251103115022-4mmc4iz","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115022-4mmc4iz","updated":"20251103115103"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115024-7tjevig","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115024-7tjevig","updated":"20251103115103"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115024-6e0mi20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115024-6e0mi20","updated":"20251103115103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少 OverDraw"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115026-9hmu64u","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115026-9hmu64u","updated":"20251103115102"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115026-jij0ynp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115026-jij0ynp","updated":"20251103115026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优化UI系统"}]},{"ID":"20251103115059-vyucgjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115059-vyucgjz","updated":"20251103115102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少叠层，避免全屏大半透明面板，合并图集减少 DrawCall"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115029-s8ni7me","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115029-s8ni7me","updated":"20251103115029"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115029-hymvjlv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115029-hymvjlv","updated":"20251103115029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剔除不可见对象"}]},{"ID":"20251103115030-xaguh72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115030-xaguh72","updated":"20251103115050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230709202343-5qy8x8e","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Occlusion Culling"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250918112151-yiebfgs","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"视锥剔除"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115237-qarpswy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251103115237-qarpswy","updated":"20251103145043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"OverDraw"}]},{"ID":"20251103115301-kgtdmrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115301-kgtdmrs","updated":"20251103115327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"OverDraw（过度绘制、叠加绘制） 指同一个屏幕像素在一帧中被重复绘制多次，上一次计算结果会被覆盖或叠加"}]},{"ID":"20251103115322-eeedqu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115322-eeedqu1","updated":"20251103115322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20251103115310-slhatqw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115310-slhatqw","updated":"20251103115318"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115310-tjlwzsk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115310-tjlwzsk","updated":"20251103115310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115310-eg5euoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115310-eg5euoo","updated":"20251103115310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不透明物体"}]},{"ID":"20251103115311-o3hqfrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115311-o3hqfrg","updated":"20251103115311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后面被挡住的像素，仍然会运行片元着色器，只是最后写入时可能被深度测试（ZTest）丢弃"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115310-d3rvq1d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115310-d3rvq1d","updated":"20251103115310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115310-y1zs0rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115310-y1zs0rb","updated":"20251103115310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半透明物体"}]},{"ID":"20251103115312-wf44ose","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115312-wf44ose","updated":"20251103115312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为需要 叠加混合 (Alpha Blend)，所以每个透明层都会真实运行片元着色器并参与混合"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115310-65ytrej","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115310-65ytrej","updated":"20251103115318"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115310-lqwtmo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115310-lqwtmo7","updated":"20251103115310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI、粒子、屏幕特效"}]},{"ID":"20251103115313-i335nwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115313-i335nwm","updated":"20251103115318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当 UI 元素、粒子特效、屏幕后处理效果层层叠加时，OverDraw 现象更严重"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115329-fblwi9z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251103115329-fblwi9z","updated":"20251103115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么 OverDraw 会影响性能"}]},{"ID":"20251103115405-7z6zp87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115405-7z6zp87","updated":"20251103115429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之所以 OverDraw 会影响性能，主要原因就是会增加计算开销，消耗内存带宽，消耗填充率"}]},{"ID":"20251103115405-8jaw4sg","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115405-8jaw4sg","updated":"20251103115424"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115424-kztlrbq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115424-kztlrbq","updated":"20251103115424"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115424-6h7a9tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115424-6h7a9tr","updated":"20251103115424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"片元着色器重复执行"}]},{"ID":"20251103115432-hub6ytq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115432-hub6ytq","updated":"20251103115432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不透明物体即便被遮挡，也需要跑一次片元着色器\n半透明物体一定要逐层计算，无法依赖深度丢弃"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115424-ynhoztp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115424-ynhoztp","updated":"20251103115424"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115424-fwdzval","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115424-fwdzval","updated":"20251103115424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"带宽浪费"}]},{"ID":"20251103115434-p95bw6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115434-p95bw6x","updated":"20251103115436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每次片元计算都会 读取纹理 并 写入帧缓冲，增加显存带宽消耗"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115424-md5lwwd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115424-md5lwwd","updated":"20251103115424"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115424-s530eol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115424-s530eol","updated":"20251103115424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"填充率压力"}]},{"ID":"20251103115442-y210aam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115442-y210aam","updated":"20251103115442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屏幕像素总数固定，但 OverDraw 会造成 每个像素要算多次\nGPU 的填充率预算会被快速耗尽"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115405-0wzgbgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115405-0wzgbgh","updated":"20251103115415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在以下场景时，很容易出现 OverDraw 现象"}]},{"ID":"20251103115411-zol7i3j","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115411-zol7i3j","updated":"20251103115452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115411-bmqjz9x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115411-bmqjz9x","updated":"20251103115452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115411-o71lkvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115411-o71lkvk","updated":"20251103115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI 界面"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115411-z4qc2g3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115411-z4qc2g3","updated":"20251103115411"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115411-vwgfev1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115411-vwgfev1","updated":"20251103115411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒子特效"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115411-cl3ac7i","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115411-cl3ac7i","updated":"20251103115411"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115411-jjfy6it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115411-jjfy6it","updated":"20251103115411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"密集树叶"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115409-pkfz31b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115409-pkfz31b","updated":"20251103115409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251103115408-cp68rgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115408-cp68rgd","updated":"20251103115448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这些画面看起来挺简单，但是其中隐藏的 OverDraw 会让 GPU 消耗暴涨"}]},{"ID":"20251103115448-450aqvy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251103115448-450aqvy","updated":"20251103120337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于 OverDraw 的优化思路"}]},{"ID":"20251103115515-j7mkhyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115515-j7mkhyn","updated":"20251103115522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根据刚才的知识学习，优化 OverDraw 的主要思路为："}]},{"ID":"20251103115524-i7huxzw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115524-i7huxzw","updated":"20251103120313"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115548-cu4364d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115548-cu4364d","updated":"20251103115548"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115548-ksmut3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115548-ksmut3n","updated":"20251103115548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针对不透明物体优化"}]},{"ID":"20251103115559-oh4xmes","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115559-oh4xmes","updated":"20251103115559"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115558-nz5nbcp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115558-nz5nbcp","updated":"20251103115558"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115558-z29h4r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115558-z29h4r9","updated":"20251103115613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从前向后渲染"}]},{"ID":"20251103115614-8j4u9my","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115614-8j4u9my","updated":"20251103115635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 内部处理不透明物体就已经采用了这种方案，会自动按 相机到物体的距离，从近到远 排序进行渲染\n我们也可以手动调整渲染队列或排序层，让对象先渲染，这样后面挡住的片元会被 Early-Z 丢弃，不跑片元 Shader"}]},{"ID":"20251103115637-69m8u1v","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251103115637-69m8u1v","updated":"20251103115650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251103115650-37w57zv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20251103115650-37w57zv","updated":"20251103115707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Early-Z（提前深度测试）"}]},{"ID":"20251103115653-kcstxeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115653-kcstxeu","updated":"20251103115658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在片元着色器运行之前，GPU 先把即将绘制的片元的深度和 Z-Buffer 比较\n如果判定它在后面（被遮挡），直接丢弃，根本不跑片元 Shader，这样可以节省大量 GPU 开销\n当透明或半透明物体时，关闭深度写入等情况，它会失效"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115603-3fdmb66","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115603-3fdmb66","updated":"20251103115603"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115603-zannmf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115603-zannmf3","updated":"20251103115731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遮挡剔除（Occlusion Culling）"}]},{"ID":"20251103115714-ep6jsyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115714-ep6jsyj","updated":"20251103115726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 Unity 提供的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230709202343-5qy8x8e","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Occlusion Culling"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可避免完全不可见的物体进入渲染"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115716-zqmur62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115716-zqmur62","updated":"20251103115717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115548-n078arm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115548-n078arm","updated":"20251103115548"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115548-74w6etk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115548-74w6etk","updated":"20251103115548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针对半透明物体优化"}]},{"ID":"20251103115739-36j0yit","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115739-36j0yit","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115751-lu7bmjw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115751-lu7bmjw","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115751-50xr3b9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115751-50xr3b9","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少透明层数、面积"}]},{"ID":"20251103115752-qt2l3jq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115752-qt2l3jq","updated":"20251103115752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI 背景、HUD 尽量合并图层，少用大面积 透明混合"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115751-ml5uyc2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115751-ml5uyc2","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115751-8egwtgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115751-8egwtgj","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Alpha Test 替代 Alpha Blend"}]},{"ID":"20251103115754-mav5s5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115754-mav5s5m","updated":"20251103115856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"树叶、栅栏，用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241120123139-t3fekhe","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Alpha Test"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（Clip）代替 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241121121110-xa0nvgw","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Alpha Blend"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，让深度测试能提前丢弃片元"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115751-ztqu29m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115751-ztqu29m","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115751-6js2eoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115751-6js2eoe","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排序优化"}]},{"ID":"20251103115759-awc1hzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115759-awc1hzt","updated":"20251103115759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"透明物体按从远到近绘制，减少不必要的重复混合"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115751-04u706p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115751-04u706p","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115751-frf3g0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115751-frf3g0p","updated":"20251103115751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"特殊替代方案"}]},{"ID":"20251103115801-mr54ecq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115801-mr54ecq","updated":"20251103115940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒子系统远处改用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250101153724-a8y6y2s","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"广告牌效果"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，降低粒子数量和透明叠加"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115748-272m1be","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115748-272m1be","updated":"20251103115748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115548-e6xrwmt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103115548-e6xrwmt","updated":"20251103120313"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103115548-yodq069","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115548-yodq069","updated":"20251103120008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针对UI系统优化"}]},{"ID":"20251103120008-fav2iuu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120008-fav2iuu","updated":"20251103120313"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120019-0xvadcl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120019-0xvadcl","updated":"20251103120019"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120019-x0osyjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120019-x0osyjj","updated":"20251103120019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图集 + 批处理"}]},{"ID":"20251103120020-gcl5z1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120020-gcl5z1z","updated":"20251103120020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少 DrawCall，但也要避免大图集带来过多 OverDraw"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120019-8hrppmv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120019-8hrppmv","updated":"20251103120019"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120019-a9y6byh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120019-a9y6byh","updated":"20251103120019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少叠层"}]},{"ID":"20251103120021-n0kmm0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120021-n0kmm0h","updated":"20251103120021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI 设计时避免多层全屏半透明面板"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120019-jfaycwv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120019-jfaycwv","updated":"20251103120313"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120019-l1aslma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120019-l1aslma","updated":"20251103120310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RectMask2D"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ / "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Stencil"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 替代全屏 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Mask"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251103120022-vgovvih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120022-vgovvih","updated":"20251103120313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用普通 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230813021224-jojg4u2","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Mask"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 相当于多了一层全屏绘制，浪费填充率，如果只需要矩形裁剪，使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230815033744-1awjizz","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"RectMask2D"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251103120222-51b35h4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120222-51b35h4","updated":"20251103120240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RectMask2D"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是 Unity 提供的一个 更轻量级的 UI Mask\n它不是通过额外绘制 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Mask"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 图层，而是用 矩形裁剪（裁剪坐标系）\n不会产生额外的全屏 OverDraw，性能比普通 Mask 好很多"}]},{"ID":"20251103120244-riuquqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120244-riuquqi","updated":"20251103120259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果想要复杂形状裁剪，用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Stencil"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\nStencil Buffer（模板缓冲）是 GPU 提供的一种逐像素标记机制\n我们可以在自定义 Shader 中利用它来实现"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120019-ntph3uz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120019-ntph3uz","updated":"20251103120019"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120019-021ahu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120019-021ahu3","updated":"20251103120019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI Renderer 独立渲染"}]},{"ID":"20251103120025-pcqmglb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120025-pcqmglb","updated":"20251103120031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免和 3D 场景互相叠加 OverDraw，相当于 UI 和场景用两个摄像机单独进行处理"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103115539-jbenvg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103115539-jbenvg3","updated":"20251103115540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251103120337-012i2a1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251103120337-012i2a1","updated":"20251104114504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存带宽"}]},{"ID":"20251103120452-fy22zbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120452-fy22zbh","updated":"20251103120524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存带宽指的是，GPU 在单位时间内，显存（VRAM）和 GPU 内部之间能传输的数据量，常用单位：GB/s（每秒多少 GB）"}]},{"ID":"20251103120520-eq0rnmy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120520-eq0rnmy","updated":"20251103120542"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120520-drvwbu9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120520-drvwbu9","updated":"20251103120542"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120520-a911x0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120520-a911x0k","updated":"20251103120542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PC显卡：100 GB "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1 TB/s"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120521-rfgnmsq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120521-rfgnmsq","updated":"20251103120539"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120521-a8fij9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120521-a8fij9n","updated":"20251103120539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏主机：200 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 600 GB/s"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120521-0r8hcur","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120521-0r8hcur","updated":"20251103120538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120521-e8zggru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120521-e8zggru","updated":"20251103120538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移动设备：30 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 200 GB/s"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120505-2ww7yih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120505-2ww7yih","updated":"20251103123344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 内部"}]},{"ID":"20251103120558-1z1g01f","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120558-1z1g01f","updated":"20251103123307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120558-3sd8zi8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120558-3sd8zi8","updated":"20251103120558"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120558-achawnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120558-achawnh","updated":"20251103120612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ALU（算数逻辑单元，Arithmetic Logic Unit）"}]},{"ID":"20251103120614-gn8aq9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120614-gn8aq9f","updated":"20251103123200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最基础的计算单元，负责加减乘除、位运算、逻辑运算等\n比如着色器中的数学计算，就是由它来处理的\n它 是 GPU 的最小 “工人”，做具体数学计算的"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120558-ammv5we","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120558-ammv5we","updated":"20251103120558"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120558-h62wiqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120558-h62wiqf","updated":"20251103120620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SM（流式多处理器，Streaming Multiprocessor）"}]},{"ID":"20251103120622-wdvryh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120622-wdvryh0","updated":"20251103123221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"NVIDIA 架构里的术语（AMD 里叫 CU (计算单元， Compute Unit) ）\n一个 SM 中包含很多 ALU（算数逻辑单元）、寄存器、共享内存、调度器 等等\n它的主要功能就是负责调度和并行执行成千上万个线程\n它 是 GPU 里的一个小工厂，里面有很多工人（ALU） 和 管理员（调度器） 以及仓库（寄存器、缓存）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120558-bx06o7c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103120558-bx06o7c","updated":"20251103123307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103120558-wbrgo6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120558-wbrgo6k","updated":"20251103120558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"着色器核心"}]},{"ID":"20251103123230-32e9yis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123230-32e9yis","updated":"20251103123253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厂商宣传时最常说的单位"}]},{"ID":"20251103123255-yreacuh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123255-yreacuh","updated":"20251103123307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123256-yasmszl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123256-yasmszl","updated":"20251103123256"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123256-bolc6so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123256-bolc6so","updated":"20251103123256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"NVIDIA 叫 CUDA Core（统一计算设备架构核心）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103123257-7ht0hua","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123257-7ht0hua","updated":"20251103123257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123257-22bwuvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123257-22bwuvj","updated":"20251103123257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AMD 叫 Stream Processor（流处理器）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103123258-836p0sh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123258-836p0sh","updated":"20251103123307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123258-n6i8e2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123258-n6i8e2v","updated":"20251103123307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Intel 或 移动设备 GPU 叫 Shader Core（着色器核心）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103123234-lcdj08b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123234-lcdj08b","updated":"20251103123245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它是 ALU（算数逻辑单元）集合体，负责运行着色器指令（顶点、片元、计算等）\n它是 GPU 对外宣传的工人数目，里面的工人就是 ALU（算数逻辑单元）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103120554-3grcz67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103120554-3grcz67","updated":"20251103123614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 外部"}]},{"ID":"20251103123356-u6ox7m3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123356-u6ox7m3","updated":"20251103123356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显存（VRAM）一般是 GPU 封装在一起的 独立芯片"}]},{"ID":"20251103123321-covby7n","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123321-covby7n","updated":"20251104113513"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123357-3i6d2h3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123357-3i6d2h3","updated":"20251103123357"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123357-92ty3zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123357-92ty3zw","updated":"20251103123357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"独显：显存独立，紧贴 GPU 芯片"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103123358-0sgrj6g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123358-0sgrj6g","updated":"20251104113513"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123358-aq770nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123358-aq770nt","updated":"20251104113513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"集显 / 移动端（大部分游戏主机）：显存 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 系统内存，GPU 和 CPU 共用同一内存池"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103123354-meoogwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123354-meoogwg","updated":"20251103123535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显存是 GPU 外部大仓库，里面存储着 顶点数据、纹理、Shader 常量、渲染目标（RenderTarget）、深度/颜色缓冲等\nSM（流式多处理器）需要从显存中搬运数据过来（会放在寄存器或共享内存中），然后把数据分给 着色器核心 进行计算\n着色器核心中的 ALU（算数逻辑单元）需要不断从寄存器、缓存，必要时还会直接从显存中拿数据进行计算"}]},{"ID":"20251103123448-krtjwih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123448-krtjwih","updated":"20251103123448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话："}]},{"ID":"20251103123550-dd4f215","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123550-dd4f215","updated":"20251103123552"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123552-f1fuhjx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123552-f1fuhjx","updated":"20251103123552"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123552-vfae818","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123552-vfae818","updated":"20251103123552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ALU（算数逻辑单元）是一个工人，只会做加减乘除、逻辑运算"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103123553-n4bxisc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123553-n4bxisc","updated":"20251103123553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123553-ixnnseo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123553-ixnnseo","updated":"20251103123553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader Core (着色器核心) 是一组工人，负责跑一条着色器指令"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103123553-7g7bb03","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103123553-7g7bb03","updated":"20251103123553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103123553-ud383ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123553-ud383ae","updated":"20251103123553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SM（流式多处理器）是一个小工厂，里面有成百上千个工人，还有仓库（寄存器、共享内存），管理器（调度器）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103123546-r2jr5dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103123546-r2jr5dd","updated":"20251103123605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 就是一个大工厂，里面有几十到上百个小工厂（SM)，可以同时开工，显存 就是存储原料（各种数据）的一个大仓库\n内存带宽 就是一条从大仓库运原料到小工厂的输送带，决定单位时间内可以运送多少原料（数据）"}]},{"ID":"20251103123628-23dkxc1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251103123628-23dkxc1","updated":"20251104114504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么内存带宽会影响性能"}]},{"ID":"20251103142358-4hz5hd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142358-4hz5hd1","updated":"20251103142403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 渲染过程中会频繁的访问显存读取或写入数据\nGPU 会读取：顶点数据、纹理、贴图、深度缓冲 等等数据\nGPU 会写入：颜色缓冲、深度缓冲、后处理结果 等等数据"}]},{"ID":"20251103142358-8ztq40b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142358-8ztq40b","updated":"20251103142416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 内部的计算单元（ALU、SM、着色器核心）执行速度是很快的\n但它们需要不断从显存中存取数据，如果内存带宽不足，数据就不能及时送到计算单元，让内存带宽成为性能瓶颈"}]},{"ID":"20251103142421-8423p93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142421-8423p93","updated":"20251103142431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相当于 GPU 中计算单元计算很快，但是迟迟拿不到数据，GPU 就会游手好闲的等待数据\n其实并不是 GPU 算力不足，而是由于内存带宽造成了 GPU 的性能浪费，不能达到最好的状态"}]},{"ID":"20251103142358-mwitcxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142358-mwitcxg","updated":"20251103142502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：内存带宽带来性能影响的原因是，输送带（内存带宽）数据搬运速度跟不上工厂中工人（Shader Core / ALU）的计算处理速度，导致 GPU（大工厂）算力浪费"}]},{"ID":"20251103142358-0mq2pua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142358-0mq2pua","updated":"20251103142511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"什么原因可能造成内存带宽瓶颈"}]},{"ID":"20251103142514-77ybchn","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142514-77ybchn","updated":"20251104113906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142522-25mja7m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142522-25mja7m","updated":"20251103142522"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142522-vzsu8n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142522-vzsu8n3","updated":"20251103142522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分辨率和填充率过高"}]},{"ID":"20251103142640-p3b2pqe","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142640-p3b2pqe","updated":"20251103142640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142639-pm93ue2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142639-pm93ue2","updated":"20251103142639"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142639-i57nc57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142639-i57nc57","updated":"20251103142644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高分辨率渲染（4k、8k）"}]},{"ID":"20251103142645-w031zae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142645-w031zae","updated":"20251103142645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像素数巨增，颜色缓冲、深度缓冲数据量暴涨"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142641-zkuwd2f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142641-zkuwd2f","updated":"20251103142641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142641-sfs5ole","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142641-sfs5ole","updated":"20251103142704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多重采样抗锯齿（MSAA 2× / 4× / 8×）"}]},{"ID":"20251103142648-mw788nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142648-mw788nx","updated":"20251103142648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每像素要写多份数据，带宽需求成倍增加"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142642-gg7tly4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142642-gg7tly4","updated":"20251103142642"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142642-aw9rx1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142642-aw9rx1m","updated":"20251103142650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量 OverDraw"}]},{"ID":"20251103142651-mhl10ge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142651-mhl10ge","updated":"20251103142717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个像素被写多次，重复读写显存，\n一般 UI 半透明、粒子特效、后处理效果叠加都会导致带宽消耗剧增"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142522-a0jt16z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142522-a0jt16z","updated":"20251103142748"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142522-yr2aqme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142522-yr2aqme","updated":"20251103142720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"纹理访问压力大"}]},{"ID":"20251103142720-5ohknh0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142720-5ohknh0","updated":"20251103142748"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142726-dc9o5fu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142726-dc9o5fu","updated":"20251103142726"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142726-wbwteea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142726-wbwteea","updated":"20251103142726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 超高分辨率纹理，GPU 每次采样需要从显存搬很多数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142726-mluzuw6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142726-mluzuw6","updated":"20251103142726"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142726-fkih6jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142726-fkih6jz","updated":"20251103142726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺少 Mipmap 或 错误采样（远处物体还用 4K 贴图）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142726-0qf1fs6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142726-0qf1fs6","updated":"20251103142748"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142726-0kx1ih5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142726-0kx1ih5","updated":"20251103142748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未压缩纹理格式（RGBA32：4 字节/像素，ASTC 压缩：可能 \u003c1 字节/像素）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142726-eokugdn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142726-eokugdn","updated":"20251103142726"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142726-i35m98k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142726-i35m98k","updated":"20251103142726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多贴图采样（法线、粗糙度、金属度分开存，采样次数多）"}]},{"ID":"20251103142735-beypitc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142735-beypitc","updated":"20251103142735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移动 GPU 尤其容易因此卡死"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142522-isygxen","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142522-isygxen","updated":"20251104113906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142522-ew917z2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142522-ew917z2","updated":"20251103142613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RenderTarget"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 过大 / 过多"}]},{"ID":"20251103142540-42uhejq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142540-42uhejq","updated":"20251104113906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RenderTarget"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 指 GPU 渲染管线里 片元着色器输出结果要写入的缓冲区，Unity 里常用的就是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RenderTexture"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n任何 GPU 可以写入的缓冲区都可以称为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RenderTarget"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n使用高精度 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RenderTexture"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，每像素字节数非常高，使用延迟渲染时，一次写多个缓冲（法线、深度、材质参数）\n屏幕后处理频繁 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref code","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250104161256-ba3bt1e","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Blit"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 全屏，每一步都要读写一整张 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RenderTexture"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142522-31jubw3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142522-31jubw3","updated":"20251103142522"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142522-10kdbgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142522-10kdbgr","updated":"20251103142522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硬件和系统限制"}]},{"ID":"20251103142529-ui4lsx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142529-ui4lsx0","updated":"20251103142530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显存位宽不足，显存频率较低"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142358-14f27qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142358-14f27qm","updated":"20251103142358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251103142358-wy7n9iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142358-wy7n9iy","updated":"20251103142821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：只要是游戏中单位时间内当 GPU 的数据读写需求大于显存带宽承载能力时，就会形成内存带宽瓶颈"}]},{"ID":"20251103142358-pyviwh1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142358-pyviwh1","updated":"20251104114504"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142851-h2jdo86","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142851-h2jdo86","updated":"20251103142851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142851-m41uq90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142851-m41uq90","updated":"20251103142851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4K 显示器：830 万像素"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142851-lky1ps0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142851-lky1ps0","updated":"20251103142851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142851-o63biaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142851-o63biaw","updated":"20251103142851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帧率：60FPS"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142852-63riics","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142852-63riics","updated":"20251104114039"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142852-7p4gnug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142852-7p4gnug","updated":"20251104114039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渲染目标格式（一帧的颜色缓冲所占大小）："}]},{"ID":"20251103142902-l9vdzjl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142902-l9vdzjl","updated":"20251104114009"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142902-9svafir","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142902-9svafir","updated":"20251104114008"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142902-rdbzeip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142902-rdbzeip","updated":"20251104114008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RGBA8：4 字节/像素  =  33MB"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142903-v6wfx4a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142903-v6wfx4a","updated":"20251104114009"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142903-kgns326","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142903-kgns326","updated":"20251104114009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RGBA16F：8 字节/像素  =  66MB"}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142903-iln774p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142903-iln774p","updated":"20251104114009"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142903-3myj51j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142903-3myj51j","updated":"20251104114009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RGBA32F：16 字节/像素  =  133MB"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251103142856-pz3ysig","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142856-pz3ysig","updated":"20251104114504"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142856-ckqby99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142856-ckqby99","updated":"20251104114504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1s 带宽需求（假设一秒 60 帧）"}]},{"ID":"20251103142859-7al4asl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142859-7al4asl","updated":"20251104114450"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142858-136ag87","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251103142858-136ag87","updated":"20251103142913"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251103142858-vivkpe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103142858-vivkpe0","updated":"20251103142913"},"Children":[{"Type":"N